"You scan your surroundings for a good spot to camp, finding a clear space" 
"among the trees where you gather dry branches to build a warm, crackling fire." 
"With a hungry stomach reminding you of your physical needs, you unpack your" 
"supplies and prepare a simple meal." 
"****"
"As night unfolds, instead of resting, you choose to use the time to hone your"
"skills. The sound of clashing metal and your swift body movements fill the air" 
"as you throw yourself into a rigorous training session, practicing intricate" 
"swordplay and knife maneuvers that fuel your drive to become stronger."   
"****"
"Armed with sharpened blades and a renewed spirit, you step out of this rest" 
"stop stronger and ready to face the challenges ahead."
""
